#
# The run ledger of resource-algebra's proof receipt (PROOF-POLICY §8.5.1).
# One run of one leg a line, as scripts/proof-receipt.sh --run-row prints it:
#   prover | run | commit | checker | invocation | inputs sha256 | what the
#   run reported | state | reason | axioms | imports | trusted base | image
#
# This file is data and it is append-only: a row is never edited, moved or
# removed, and scripts/proof-receipt.sh --check refuses a ledger that differs
# from the default branch's in any row that branch holds.  A run is added
# with --record.  The states of a receipt that is no longer current (stale,
# superseded) are derived by the generator from these rows and the tree, so
# no row needs an edit when a leg's inputs change or a newer run is recorded.
#
# One proofs.yml run on main checks all three legs; each row names its job.
# Every gate fails on any axiom, so no row lists one.  Only the Rocq job runs
# in an image that ships its checker, pinned by digest, so only its row names
# an image (docs/status/PROOF-NEEDS.adoc, PN-7).  Runs before this file
# existed are listed in docs/status/PROOF-STATUS.adoc, Earlier receipts.
